<headline>FINAL PRICING - Whatcom County, Wash..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it received the written award on $9.990 million of Whatcom County, Wash., limited tax general obligation and refunding bonds, 1997, with a top yield of 5.25 percent.</p>
